{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To solve the problem, we need to account for all the chimes the clock makes in a 24-hour period. We will break it down into the different types of chimes and sum them up.\n\n1. **Chimes at 15 minutes after the hour:**\n   - The clock chimes 2 times at 15 minutes after each hour.\n   - There are 24 hours in a day, so there are 24 such chimes per day.\n   - Therefore, the total chimes at 15 minutes after each hour in 24 hours is \\(24 \\times 2 = 48\\).\n\n2. **Chimes at 30 minutes after the hour:**\n   - The clock chimes 4 times at 30 minutes after each hour.\n   - There are 24 hours in a day, so there are 24 such chimes per day.\n   - Therefore, the total chimes at 30 minutes after each hour in 24 hours is \\(24 \\times 4 = 96\\).\n\n3. **Chimes at 45 minutes after the hour:**\n   - The clock chimes 6 times at 45 minutes after each hour.\n   - There are 24 hours in a day, so there are 24 such chimes per day.\n   - Therefore, the total chimes at 45 minutes after each hour in 24 hours is \\(24 \\times 6 = 144\\).\n\n","prefix_end":1004,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":true,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,11625,279,3491,11,582,1184,311,2692,369,678,279,521,1733,279,8866,3643,304,264,220,17,19,21231,4168,13,1205,686,1438,432,1495,1119,279,2155,4494,315,521,1733,323,2629,1105,705,382,16,13,3070,1143,1733,518,220,16,20,4420,1283,279,6460,25,1019,256,481,576,8866,521,1733,220,17,3039,518,220,16,20,4420,1283,1817,6460,624,256,481,2619,525,220,17,19,4115,304,264,1899,11,773,1052,525,220,17,19,1741,521,1733,817,1899,624,256,481,15277,11,279,2790,521,1733,518,220,16,20,4420,1283,1817,6460,304,220,17,19,4115,374,17767,17,19,1124,15136,220,17,284,220,19,23,59,3593,17,13,3070,1143,1733,518,220,18,15,4420,1283,279,6460,25,1019,256,481,576,8866,521,1733,220,19,3039,518,220,18,15,4420,1283,1817,6460,624,256,481,2619,525,220,17,19,4115,304,264,1899,11,773,1052